        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9024/153, Milan 6 Inch Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 6 inch kitchen cabinet door pull is great for any modern kitchen. The sleek shape is inspired by the high-fashion of Milan. Available in today's most popular finishes, the Milan 6 Inch Cabinet Handle will match your tastes; from satin brass, to polished chrome, these contemporary finishes will compliment any space.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9024\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/milan-4-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9024-102\"><b>4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/milan-8-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9024-203\"><b>8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/milan-10-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9024-254\"><b>10 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/milan-12-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9024-305\"><b>12 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/milan-18-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9024-457\"><b>18 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9024 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sold Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
